<title>DENMARK: Danish Great Belt issues 500 mln Dkk 4pct bond.</title>
<headline>Danish Great Belt issues 500 mln Dkk 4pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Wednesday by arranger Unidanmark (Unibank).</p>
<p>BORROWER: A/S STOREBAELTSFORBINDELSEN (GREAT BELT FIXED LINK).</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 500 MILLION DANISH CROWNS.</p>
<p>COUPON:FOUR PERCENT.</p>
<p>MATURITY: 20 DECEMBER 2002.</p>
<p>ISSUE DATE: 24 APRIL 1997</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE: TO BE ADVISED</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
